                <!-- faq area start -->
                <section class="app-faq-area mm-faq p-relative" aria-labelledby="mm-faq-title">
                    <div class="container container-1530">
                        <div class="row align-items-start gx-xl-5">
                            <div class="col-lg-5">
                                <div class="app-faq-heading mm-faq__intro p-relative mb-50">
                                    <span class="mm-section-kicker">FAQ</span>
                                    <h2 id="mm-faq-title" class="mm-faq__title">Questions,<br><em>answered.</em></h2>
                                    <p>Everything you need to know before building, exporting and managing signatures with Mailmyra.</p>
                                    <figure class="mm-faq__visual">
                                        <img src="assets/img/mailmyra/faq/mailmyra-faq-wide-v2.png" alt="Mailmyra questions resolved across email signatures" loading="lazy">
                                        <figcaption><i class="fa-light fa-circle-check"></i> Inbox-ready answers <span>6 clients covered</span></figcaption>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-7">
                                <div class="app-faq-wrap mm-faq__accordion z-index-1">
                                    <div class="ai-faq-accordion-wrap">
                                        <div class="accordion" id="mailmyraFaq">
                                            <div class="accordion-items">
                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                    <button class="accordion-buttons" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mailmyraFaqOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="mailmyraFaqOne">
                                                        What does Mailmyra do?
                                                        <span class="accordion-icon"></span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </h2>
                                                <div id="mailmyraFaqOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#mailmyraFaq">
                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                        <p>Mailmyra helps you design professional email signatures, preview them across major inboxes and export clean, table-based HTML that stays consistent when it reaches the recipient.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="accordion-items">
                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                    <button class="accordion-buttons collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mailmyraFaqTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mailmyraFaqTwo">
                                                        Which email clients are supported?
                                                        <span class="accordion-icon"></span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </h2>
                                                <div id="mailmyraFaqTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mailmyraFaq">
                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                        <p>You can preview and prepare signatures for Outlook Classic, New Outlook, Gmail, Apple Mail and iOS Mail, with layouts built around real email-client rendering constraints.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="accordion-items">
                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                    <button class="accordion-buttons collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mailmyraFaqThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mailmyraFaqThree">
                                                        Do I need to know HTML?
                                                        <span class="accordion-icon"></span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </h2>
                                                <div id="mailmyraFaqThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mailmyraFaq">
                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                        <p>No. Choose a template, enter your details and adjust the style visually. Mailmyra generates the email-safe HTML and keeps the technical structure out of your way.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="accordion-items">
                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                    <button class="accordion-buttons collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mailmyraFaqFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mailmyraFaqFour">
                                                        Can one template be used by a whole team?
                                                        <span class="accordion-icon"></span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </h2>
                                                <div id="mailmyraFaqFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mailmyraFaq">
                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                        <p>Yes. Create one approved signature system, lock the brand rules that matter and apply the same visual hierarchy to every teammate while keeping personal details accurate.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="accordion-items">
                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                    <button class="accordion-buttons collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mailmyraFaqFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mailmyraFaqFive">
                                                        Can campaign banners be updated centrally?
                                                        <span class="accordion-icon"></span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </h2>
                                                <div id="mailmyraFaqFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mailmyraFaq">
                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                        <p>Campaign content can be prepared once and kept consistent across selected senders, so launches and calls to action do not depend on manual edits in individual signatures.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="accordion-items">
                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                    <button class="accordion-buttons collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mailmyraFaqSix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mailmyraFaqSix">
                                                        How do I export and install a signature?
                                                        <span class="accordion-icon"></span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </h2>
                                                <div id="mailmyraFaqSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mailmyraFaq">
                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                        <p>Copy the signature as rich HTML or download the .htm file, then follow the client-specific installation guide for Outlook, Gmail, Apple Mail or your preferred inbox.</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
